          <div style="font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gray1)">Projects completed across Ontario</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#1e1e1e;padding:32px;border-left:3px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)">
