        <h3>Not a big-box firm</h3>
        <p>You will not be handed to a junior PM after the sales call and forgotten. The people who scope your project are the people who deliver it. Your deadline doesn't become a line item in someone else's portfolio management problem.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="not-us-card r">
        <div class="not-us-x">✕</div>
        <h3>Not a solo operator</h3>
        <p>We have the bench depth to scale when your timeline demands it. If we are three days behind on Thursday, we have the crew to recover by Monday. A one-person operation cannot do that. We can.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="not-us-card r">
        <div class="not-us-x">✕</div>
        <h3>Not a generalist</h3>
        <p>We do commercial interiors. Full stop. No residential side projects, no general construction, no scope we haven't delivered before. When you hire VNG, you are hiring a team that has done exactly what you need, hundreds of times.</p>
